 c8d7afefd821fc55e7d3c1b4d191ae074c7dc6bfa00fbede859fb3d4f71ede23543f3d4a46a9bc71cd8b46361fdaeb3c53f09909341129c484252ac38aa0a51e  0231-power-supply-qcom_pm8150b-terminate-on-the-analog-cu.patch
+c1c872fda7cf56db8e172b09f26deb95e1373efe0af2fd4e79b294f774ed8c7226f46916b290e313f4a9190b2993737e80e335bbc0e816359f99b704680a12d9  0232-PCI-host-common-keep-D3cold-off-for-devices-that-hav.patch
